    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d323-a3">

                <pb facs="0446" n="326" xml:id="pg326"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Messrs. Sanchez and
                            Velasquez to Minister Dawson.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ministry of Hacienda and Commerce</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-02-07"><hi rendition="#italic">February 7,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: We, the undersigned signatories of the
                    convention of January 20 last, as representatives of the Dominican Government,
                    which was also signed by you and by Albert C. Dillingham, as representative of
                    the Government of the United States, have the honor to bring to your attention
                    by these presents that the only modification which we believe proper in the
                    already signed convention are: That declaring it to be ad referendum by an
                    additional clause, and that adding an article which provides that “this
                    convention shall last as long as shall be necessary for the amortization of the
                    debt which the Government of the United States takes charge of,” these being the
                    only modifications which on behalf of the Dominican Government we find ourselves
                    authorized to sign, ratifying at the same time all that has been agreed and
                    covenanted.</p>
                <p>We salute you attentively.</p>
                <closer><signed><list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Juan Fco. Sanchez</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Federico Velasquez</hi>.</item>
                        </list></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
